{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id14543776"}, "name":{"label":"woo hoo! new fun"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2021-02-06T15:06:25-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.6"}, "id":{"label":"6962896466"}, "title":{"label":"Please read before downloading"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this game about a week ago and immediately knew I had to write a review. I actually first downloaded this game on my TV, and it was really hard to control, but I thought that was just because I don’t have a game controller and it was really hard to do any games with the TV remote. I decided to download it on my mobile device, so I did. The tutorial was very hard to understand and control, but I thought that was just because I was new to the game. So I dealt with it for a little while longer, but then the characters were introduced and it wasn’t getting any easier to control. In fact, it was a lot harder. So, overall, good concept, hard to control, wouldn’t recommend for people who are easily angered especially.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
