{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id33351840"}, "name":{"label":"rtdgoldfish"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-11-10T19:22:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5"}, "id":{"label":"6631697848"}, "title":{"label":"Poor controls ruin what could be an otherwise great game"}, "content":{"label":"I love the concept. Artistic style is perfect for Lego. Music is great. Puzzles seem like they would be a lot of fun. Unfortunately, it is all RUINED by horrible controls. The camera snaps around for no good reason. You try to grab a brick but end up grabbing the one next to it which usually messes up whatever you were trying to do in the first place. This game has a ton of potential but needs a major control revamp. Too bad it will probably never be updated.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
