{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1167944450"}, "name":{"label":"paxtonisawesome6"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-10-11T08:51:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5"}, "id":{"label":"6524446262"}, "title":{"label":"How great this game is (and how much I support the devs of this game)"}, "content":{"label":"This game is really fun and I love legos, and I actually did complete the game. I would recommend this for people that like/love legos, I would like more levels though, because when I completed the game, I was really sad because there weren’t anymore levels, so please add more levels to this game. I support the devs of the game and LOVE this game. Other then not having more levels, Overall this game is really fun and and I loved it :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id241143832"}, "name":{"label":"Chelseak98"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-10-06T10:16:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5"}, "id":{"label":"6507296879"}, "title":{"label":"Love it"}, "content":{"label":"I love this game but it is far too short. Please release more levels.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id662849054"}, "name":{"label":"cheezzzzee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-10-05T21:14:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.5"}, "id":{"label":"6505331542"}, "title":{"label":"Good puzzle"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a good game for people who like to figure things out. There aren’t many instructions, but I kinda enjoyed just experimenting and figuring it out. I understand what they were going for in this game, that everything is a puzzle and you just have to find what works best for you.\nSome of the levels are a little tricky, but all easily solvable with experimentation (clicking random blocks and putting them in different places lol). I really enjoyed finding all the different aspects of the game. \nPeople who like games with one solution may not enjoy it, several of the levels can be completed many ways. \nI found the controls odd at first, but they’re really easy to use once you get the hang of it, especially after I realized I can hold and item in the air if I just don’t hold down on it. \nI would love more levels, but I don’t know if that’s gonna happen. If it does, the only thing I would recommend is making the menu and the restart button easier to find. Right now you tap in the top right corner area to bring it up, but I only figured that out when I was changing my brightness.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"6"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"7"}}, 
