{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id572704511"}, "name":{"label":"Mr.Chillidog"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-09-01T11:35:23-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"6384837754"}, "title":{"label":"Very poor controls"}, "content":{"label":"I wanted to like this game but as soon as I started playing I realized how hard it is to actually play. I’ll try to move a piece and it’ll just place it before I get it where I want. I can only play for about a minute before getting too frustrated", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id18877363"}, "name":{"label":"IndigoAK"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-08-24T22:22:52-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"6358088024"}, "title":{"label":"Terrible controls"}, "content":{"label":"The base conceit of the game is great and it looks amazing, but the controls absolutely kill it. You tap on a block and then drag it into place, except holding your finger on the screen also locks the block into place, so if you don't manage to drag the tiny little blocks to the right spot on the first try there's a good chance you'll have to pick up the block all over again. It's a complete failure of input design and make some the game far more tedious than it needs to be.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
