{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id81031645"}, "name":{"label":"Zaax"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-05-07T23:27:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"5917977103"}, "title":{"label":"It Just Clicks!"}, "content":{"label":"Not a huge LEGO fan here, but I loved this little game! Full of heart, beautifully designed and there is something satisfying about clicking in that final piece of your own creation.\n\nIf I were going to critique something, I’d want the gestures to be cleaned up a bit. For example, a two finger tap to immediately drop the selected brick would be useful. Sometimes selecting a different piece wouldn’t register, so I’d have to find a place to click in my selected brick before moving onto a new one.\n\nAs others have pointed out, it’s way too short. Gesture gripes aside, I’m hungry for the next chapter!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1165845111"}, "name":{"label":"ABowlOfColdSoup"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-05-06T22:28:28-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"5913371681"}, "title":{"label":"Sophisticated Puzzle LEGO Game"}, "content":{"label":"This game is fantastic. It tells a great story without using any words. It evolves throughout the gameplay which consists of challenging puzzles that build on one another as they go (pun intended). I felt like Indiana Jones solving the great mysteries and traps of an ancient temple. The levels help ease you into the gameplay mechanics, and it’s difficulty is rewarding to those who stick through the challenge. Taking the fundamental principles of LEGO and allowing you to solve most all their puzzles by building your way. I highly recommend it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
