{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id9965702"}, "name":{"label":"Lil Pips"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-05-02T02:41:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.1"}, "id":{"label":"5892448291"}, "title":{"label":"Super Short, STILL couldn’t wait for it to end"}, "content":{"label":"This was just awful. It ties Where Cards Fall for my least liked Arcade game. The perspective is terrible, and you can’t change it much, which makes certain positioning much harder than it needs to be. The controls are terrible. The trial and error required in some areas is terrible.\n\nThis game is thankfully short. I finished it in 45 minutes and hated at least 30 minutes of that. Deleted and good riddance.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
